    var body: some View {
        List {
            Section("Home") { Text("Hold a Home card to edit it, drag it to reorder, or tap its minus button to remove it. Tap Done when finished. Customize opens a translucent sheet above Home; drag it up for more room. Use it to add or replace cards: times, currency, next booking, weather, a saved document and Before you leave. Home stays on one screen without scrolling. The number of cards adapts to screen space and text size; cards that do not fit remain saved in Customize. Type into either currency amount on Home to convert in either direction, or use the swap button to reverse the currencies. The blue Full converter button beside Currency opens all conversion tools. Tap other cards to open their details, or tap a city to change it.") }
