                Text("Add a hotel, flight or transport booking. Select departure and arrival locations, review local dates and times, then Save. Current and upcoming bookings appear before completed ones. Saved documents appear below bookings on the same page. Search finds bookings, documents and unfinished edits by name, route, traveler, reference or note.")
                Text("Unfinished edits are saved as encrypted drafts. Resume them in My Trip, or hold a draft for Discard draft. Optional reminders use the booking's scheduled instant. Notification and Focus settings affect delivery.")
